<article class="env-lemma" id="0B72">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0B72">Lemma <span data-tag="0B72">42.30.4</span>.</a> Let $(S, \delta )$ be as in Situation <a href="/tag/02QL" data-tag="02QL">42.7.1</a>. Let $X$ be locally of finite type over $S$. Let $(\mathcal{L}, s, i : D \to X)$ be a triple as in Definition <a href="/tag/02T8" data-tag="02T8">42.29.1</a>. Let $\mathcal{N}$ be an invertible $\mathcal{O}_ X$-module. Then $i^*(c_1(\mathcal{N}) \cap \alpha ) = c_1(i^*\mathcal{N}) \cap i^*\alpha $ in $\mathop{\mathrm{CH}}\nolimits _{k - 2}(D)$ for all $\alpha \in \mathop{\mathrm{CH}}\nolimits _ k(X)$. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      With exactly the same proof as in Lemma <a href="/tag/02TO" data-tag="02TO">42.30.2</a> this follows from Lemmas <a href="/tag/02SU" data-tag="02SU">42.26.4</a>, <a href="/tag/02TJ" data-tag="02TJ">42.28.3</a>, and <a href="/tag/02TM" data-tag="02TM">42.30.1</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>